# Commits and pull requests

- Branch names: `feat/…`, `fix/…`, `chore/…`, `docs/…`.
- Commit messages: imperative, short, explain why.
- One task per PR. Aim for under ~300 changed lines.
- Fill in every section of @.github/pull_request_template.md, including "AI involvement" and "How it was tested".
- List any file you changed that is not obviously part of the task, and explain why.
- Open PRs as draft when anything is unverified.
